---
// 브랜드 이야기 (주소: /brand/)
import Base from '../../../i18n/en/layouts/Base.astro';
import { org, website, founder, aboutPage, breadcrumbs, productLd, articleLd, faqLd as makeFaq } from '../../../i18n/en/schema';
const title = "Our story";
const description = "Why we started NEUVELIF, our brand philosophy ‘Self-care begins with your skin,’ our three principles, and the path we've taken.";
const crumbs = breadcrumbs(Astro.site!, [["Home", "/en/"], ["Our story", "/en/brand/"]]);
const faqLd = makeFaq([]);
const jsonLd = [aboutPage, founder, crumbs];
---
<Base title={title} description={description} current="brand" jsonLd={jsonLd}>
{/* ── 나를 아끼는 마음은 피부에서 시작된다 ── */}
<section aria-labelledby="brand-title" style="padding: clamp(56px, 7vw, 104px) 0 clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px)">
<div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 clamp(20px, 4vw, 48px); box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; max-width: 1240px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #1170AE">ABOUT NEUVELIF</p>
<h1 id="brand-title" style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(34px, 4.4vw, 60px); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #12324F">Self-care begins<br>with your skin</h1>
<p lang="en" style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(18px, 1.8vw, 22px); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: #56626D">SELF-CARE BEGINS WITH YOUR SKIN.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; max-width: 720px; font-size: 18px; color: #3C4752">NEUVELIF is a dermocosmetic brand focused on skincare before and after skin procedures. We start with the basics you can use every day, even on skin that has become sensitive after a procedure: sun protection and cleansing.</p>
</div>
</section>

{/* ── NEUVELIF라는 이름 ── */}
<section aria-labelledby="name-title" style="border-top: 1px solid #D5E0E8; padding: clamp(48px, 6vw, 80px) 0">
<div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 clamp(20px, 4vw, 48px); box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #1170AE">OUR NAME</p>
<h2 id="name-title" style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 34px); line-height: 1.3; color: #12324F">The name NEUVELIF</h2>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 24px">
<div style="flex: 1 1 220px; border-top: 3px solid #12324F; padding-top: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px">
<p lang="en" style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 40px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; line-height: 1; color: #12324F">NEU</p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #3C4752">New</p>
</div>
<span aria-hidden="true" style="font-size: 32px; color: #8FA3B5">+</span>
<div style="flex: 1 1 220px; border-top: 3px solid #12324F; padding-top: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px">
<p lang="en" style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 40px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; line-height: 1; color: #12324F">REVIVE</p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #3C4752">Vitality that comes back</p>
</div>
<span aria-hidden="true" style="font-size: 32px; color: #8FA3B5">+</span>
<div style="flex: 1 1 220px; border-top: 3px solid #12324F; padding-top: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px">
<p lang="en" style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 40px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; line-height: 1; color: #12324F">RELIEF</p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #3C4752">Comfort</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

{/* ── 뉴베리프를 시작한 이유 ── */}
<section aria-labelledby="letter-title">
<div style="background: #12324F; color: #FFFFFF; padding: clamp(56px, 7vw, 104px) 0">
<div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 clamp(20px, 4vw, 48px); box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #8FD3F2">FOUNDER'S NOTE</p>
<h2 id="letter-title" style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 34px); line-height: 1.35">Why we started NEUVELIF</h2>
<p style="margin: 20px 0 0; font-size: clamp(17px, 1.6vw, 19px); color: #C9D6E2">After every skin procedure, I was left with the same question.</p>
<blockquote style="margin: 0; padding-left: clamp(18px, 2vw, 28px); border-left: 4px solid #8FD3F2; font-size: clamp(26px, 3.2vw, 42px); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.45; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: #FFFFFF">The procedure went well,<br>but now what should I use, and how?</blockquote>
</div>
</div>
<div style="padding: clamp(48px, 6vw, 96px) 0">
<article aria-label="A note from our CEO" style="max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 clamp(20px, 4vw, 48px); box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; border-top: 1px solid #D5E0E8; padding-top: 24px; margin-top: 12px"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: #1170AE">01</span><h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.4; color: #12324F">I looked for answers, and every source said something different</h3></div>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #1A1F24">A skin procedure ends at the clinic, but skincare starts at home that same day. Yet it was hard to know when to start after a procedure, what to use, and how.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #1A1F24">When I looked for answers, the information was all over the place. Some said you could apply products the same day; others said to put nothing on your skin for several days. Not knowing what to trust, I usually ended up just using whatever I normally used.</p>
<div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; border-top: 1px solid #D5E0E8; padding-top: 24px; margin-top: 12px"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: #1170AE">02</span><h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.4; color: #12324F">Products made for everyday skin</h3></div>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #1A1F24">But most skincare products are made with everyday skin in mind. So after a procedure, even the products you always use become hard to use.</p>
<ul aria-label="Why skincare is hard after a skin procedure" style="margin: 4px 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(300px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 12px">
<li style="border-top: 3px solid #12324F; background: #F4F7FA; padding: 18px 20px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; line-height: 1; color: #1170AE">01</span><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #12324F">Products that sting or burn</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3C4752">Many products sting or burn when applied to sensitized skin.</p></li>
<li style="border-top: 3px solid #12324F; background: #F4F7FA; padding: 18px 20px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; line-height: 1; color: #1170AE">02</span><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #12324F">Rubbing and foaming</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3C4752">Rubbing, foaming, and massaging motions are often things to avoid after a skin procedure.</p></li>
<li style="border-top: 3px solid #12324F; background: #F4F7FA; padding: 18px 20px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; line-height: 1; color: #1170AE">03</span><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #12324F">Ingredients you need to pause</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3C4752">Some products contain ingredients you need to pause for a while after a procedure, such as exfoliants or retinol.</p></li>
<li style="border-top: 3px solid #12324F; background: #F4F7FA; padding: 18px 20px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; line-height: 1; color: #1170AE">04</span><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #12324F">No guidance on timing</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3C4752">It's hard to find products that tell you when and how you can use them after a procedure.</p></li>
</ul>
<div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; border-top: 1px solid #D5E0E8; padding-top: 24px; margin-top: 12px"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: #1170AE">03</span><h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.4; color: #12324F">So I decided to make them myself</h3></div>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #1A1F24">I couldn't find the answer, so I decided to make it myself.</p>
<p style="margin: 4px 0; padding: 4px 0 4px 24px; border-left: 4px solid #1170AE; font-size: clamp(19px, 1.9vw, 23px); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.65; color: #12324F">NEUVELIF was created to solve this problem. We make skincare designed around skin that has become sensitive before and after procedures, and we tell you when and how to use it.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #1A1F24">I believe it takes time to know what a good ingredient will actually do. That's why NEUVELIF starts by publishing test results together with their conditions, rather than just ingredient names, and by explaining when and how to use our products after each procedure.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; color: #1A1F24">What I realized through this process was simple. In the end, it all came down to wanting to take care of myself. So I defined NEUVELIF's philosophy like this.</p>
<div style="margin-top: 16px; padding: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 40px) 0; border-top: 1px solid #12324F; border-bottom: 1px solid #12324F; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; text-align: center">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(24px, 2.8vw, 34px); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; color: #12324F">Self-care begins with your skin</p>
<p lang="en" style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; font-size: 15px; color: #56626D">SELF-CARE BEGINS WITH YOUR SKIN.</p>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-end; align-items: center; gap: 12px 20px; margin-top: 12px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #3C4752">CEO, NEUVELIF</p>
