<section aria-labelledby="vision-title" style="padding: clamp(48px, 6vw, 88px) 0">
<div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 clamp(20px, 4vw, 48px); box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #1170AE">OUR VISION</p>
<h2 id="vision-title" style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 34px); line-height: 1.3; color: #12324F">Three principles</h2>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px">
<div style="flex: 1 1 300px; border-top: 3px solid #12324F; padding-top: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<p lang="en" style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: #12324F">DERMATOLOGY</p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #3C4752">We design around how skin changes before and after procedures, matching timing of use and skin condition.</p>
</div>
<div style="flex: 1 1 300px; border-top: 3px solid #12324F; padding-top: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<p lang="en" style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: #12324F">INNOVATION</p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #3C4752">We relentlessly solve the discomforts customers feel, and redefine the standard for our products.</p>
</div>
<div style="flex: 1 1 300px; border-top: 3px solid #12324F; padding-top: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<p lang="en" style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: #12324F">A.I.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #3C4752">We analyze real-world usage data with A.I. to create formulas that solve problems.</p>
